        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888240/extras/c3ab0d4eb9a32ab924f26800bf35afad.avif?t=1762151346\" width=628 height=128 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls are simple—just up, down, left, and right! ...And surprisingly deep!?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888240/extras/033cae40991480e4c6d5a0d75430b794.poster.avif?t=1762151346\" width=270 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888240/extras/033cae40991480e4c6d5a0d75430b794.webm?t=1762151346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888240/extras/033cae40991480e4c6d5a0d75430b794.mp4?t=1762151346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blocks placed whenever the player's cursor moves disappear when two or more blocks of the same color are lined up. If you can't move them anymore,it's game over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the basic rules, clearing the stage means destroying all the colorful blocks placed at the start!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Versus Mode (2P)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Versus Mode, you can choose between player vs. player battles and battles against the CPU.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get a Star<br>Break the star blocks. The first player to break five star blocks wins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original<br>Similar to 1P mode, clearing the game requires destroying all the colorful blocks placed at the start.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultra Fight Da! Kyanta 2 characters “Dr. Kyanta” and “Masako” dance on screen!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upbeat BGM by composer tdhr!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from three difficulty levels—“EASY,” “NORMAL,” and “HARD”—to play!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Guidelines for Streaming and Video Posting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are free to stream gameplay videos and post videos, whether for profit or not. We would greatly appreciate it if you could include a link to the game's Steam store page in the description section of your videos or streams. Monetization on platforms such as YouTube and Twitch is also permitted.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888240/extras/c3ab0d4eb9a32ab924f26800bf35afad.avif?t=1762151346\" width=628 height=128 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls are simple—just up, down, left, and right! ...And surprisingly deep!?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888240/extras/033cae40991480e4c6d5a0d75430b794.poster.avif?t=1762151346\" width=270 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888240/extras/033cae40991480e4c6d5a0d75430b794.webm?t=1762151346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888240/extras/033cae40991480e4c6d5a0d75430b794.mp4?t=1762151346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blocks placed whenever the player's cursor moves disappear when two or more blocks of the same color are lined up. If you can't move them anymore,it's game over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the basic rules, clearing the stage means destroying all the colorful blocks placed at the start!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Versus Mode (2P)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Versus Mode, you can choose between player vs. player battles and battles against the CPU.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get a Star<br>Break the star blocks. The first player to break five star blocks wins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original<br>Similar to 1P mode, clearing the game requires destroying all the colorful blocks placed at the start.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultra Fight Da! Kyanta 2 characters “Dr. Kyanta” and “Masako” dance on screen!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upbeat BGM by composer tdhr!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from three difficulty levels—“EASY,” “NORMAL,” and “HARD”—to play!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Guidelines for Streaming and Video Posting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are free to stream gameplay videos and post videos, whether for profit or not. We would greatly appreciate it if you could include a link to the game's Steam store page in the description section of your videos or streams. Monetization on platforms such as YouTube and Twitch is also permitted.</p>",
        "short_description": "Clear the stage by destroying all the colorful blocks placed at the start! An action puzzle game where characters from “Ultra Fight Da! Kyanta 2” dance across the screen. Play solo at your leisure or enjoy competitive matches with friends!",
